flowchart TD
    A[Start height H and round r] --> B[Select proposer by weighted round robin]
    B --> C[Proposer extends PoH and builds proposal]
    C --> D[Broadcast proposal with PoH checkpoint]
    D --> E[Validators verify PoH and tx validity]
    E --> F{Prepare quorum reached}
    F -- no --> G[Timeout and next round]
    G --> B
    F -- yes --> H[Commit voting]
    H --> I{Commit quorum reached}
    I -- no --> G
    I -- yes --> J[Finalize height H and move to H+1]
